(6404305, 949264, 124346, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Could you tell me what kind of exposure metering you used? Center, point, multi, and where did you point the camera at to do the metering?.  This because you have the sun in the picture but the rest doesn''t look too dark as it should.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Could you tell me what kind of exposure metering you used? Center, point, multi, and where did you point the camera at to do the metering?.  This because you have the sun in the picture but the rest doesn''t look too dark as it should.', '2011-05-04 16:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
