(6404560, 949668, 114225, '<td valign="top">I see what you were going for here, but there are a couple of things you could do to improve the photo<br/>- There is a lot of noise, so make sure to use a low ISO<br/>- That super bright light near the bottom is pulling the viewer''s eyes. Cropping that out may have helped</td>', 'I see what you were going for here, but there are a couple of things you could do to improve the photo- There is a lot of noise, so make sure to use a low ISO- That super bright light near the bottom is pulling the viewer''s eyes. Cropping that out may have helped', '2011-05-04 22:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6404563, 949681, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like the gritty feeling, but there seems to be something slightly off about this. Like everything has a ghost effect.</td>', 'I like the gritty feeling, but there seems to be something slightly off about this. Like everything has a ghost effect.', '2011-05-04 22:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
