(6408376, 948921, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is nice; it won''t win, probably for lack of "wow" factor, and admittedly the values of the greens create a certain lack of "focus" for the viewer. the sky is troubling as well- is it blue or grey and is there enough there? But- I believe the composition is superb for what you had to work with- good flow- right out of the upper right hand of the picture and then... stop- your at the mystery point. It has a great pastoral/ late impressionist feel to it. I give you a (9)- and would give a ten if the sky was more defined or there was some blues in there to counteract all this green.</td>', 'This is nice; it won''t win, probably for lack of "wow" factor, and admittedly the values of the greens create a certain lack of "focus" for the viewer. the sky is troubling as well- is it blue or grey and is there enough there? But- I believe the composition is superb for what you had to work with- good flow- right out of the upper right hand of the picture and then... stop- your at the mystery point. It has a great pastoral/ late impressionist feel to it. I give you a (9)- and would give a ten if the sky was more defined or there was some blues in there to counteract all this green.', '2011-05-09 09:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
