(6409090, 949554, 124256, '<td valign="top">My first impulse was not to vote very high, but for some reason I thought I smelled something familiar that I couldn''t recognize right away.  Then I realized it was the smell of the US Mint and proofs.  So, you are getting a better score for triggering a cool smell memory.  Maybe it''s the shiny coinage behind glass with reflections.  Anyhow, cool.</td>', 'My first impulse was not to vote very high, but for some reason I thought I smelled something familiar that I couldn''t recognize right away.  Then I realized it was the smell of the US Mint and proofs.  So, you are getting a better score for triggering a cool smell memory.  Maybe it''s the shiny coinage behind glass with reflections.  Anyhow, cool.', '2011-05-09 23:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
