(6409096, 948839, 124256, '<td valign="top">Clever.  I like the juxtaposition of the ram out in the grass.  I like that they are arranged to look like a bench.  I wish bench translated better to bank or memory bank as the title calls out.  Still, I like the non sequitor of the bench made of ram for the bank challenge.  In the end it''s too much of a stretch to trigger a higher score, but overall I like it enough to not penalize.  Fun shot.  My favorite is that there are cute wildflowers peeking out from behind the bench.</td>', 'Clever.  I like the juxtaposition of the ram out in the grass.  I like that they are arranged to look like a bench.  I wish bench translated better to bank or memory bank as the title calls out.  Still, I like the non sequitor of the bench made of ram for the bank challenge.  In the end it''s too much of a stretch to trigger a higher score, but overall I like it enough to not penalize.  Fun shot.  My favorite is that there are cute wildflowers peeking out from behind the bench.', '2011-05-09 23:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
