(6410805, 949741, 10785, '<td valign="top">Congrats to you! You''re fairly lucky with this image placement because at DPC, you usually get dinged hard for mid frame horizons and especially for tilted horizons. The mountain range did a good job of masking that fact... Other than that, great camera work!</td>', 'Congrats to you! You''re fairly lucky with this image placement because at DPC, you usually get dinged hard for mid frame horizons and especially for tilted horizons. The mountain range did a good job of masking that fact... Other than that, great camera work!', '2011-05-11 13:57:13.000000', NULL, 0),
