(6410826, 949543, 39057, '<td valign="top"><b>EDIT: Well it seems Richard cut and ran after he mentioned his displeasure on receiving a low vote in the last four minutes. Sorry but this post may NOT make sense to someone just happening upon it...He as since deleted his comment AFTER I made my comments..but I will not delete.</b> <br/> <br/>Well since I was timed in on my comment at four minutes to go, I guess I have to post what I gave you...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=951072" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/39057/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_951072.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/39057/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_951072.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/39057/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_951072.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I gave a 5. Your second highest vote tally. You can''t always get 7s and 8s.<br/> <br/>And further, here is the previous vote for the square challenge:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=951073" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/39057/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_951073.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/39057/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_951073.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/35000-39999/39057/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_951073.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Hmmm....A 6 -- Dead on with your MODE average. <br/> <br/>Let''s put the "people mark me lower because they know who I am issue" to rest.<br/> <br/>EDIT: This is a VERY helpful post so you should tag it as such.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-05-11 14:45:12.</i></td>', 'EDIT: Well it seems Richard cut and ran after he mentioned his displeasure on receiving a low vote in the last four minutes. Sorry but this post may NOT make sense to someone just happening upon it...He as since deleted his comment AFTER I made my comments..but I will not delete.  Well since I was timed in on my comment at four minutes to go, I guess I have to post what I gave you...   I gave a 5. Your second highest vote tally. You can''t always get 7s and 8s. And further, here is the previous vote for the square challenge:   Hmmm....A 6 -- Dead on with your MODE average.  Let''s put the "people mark me lower because they know who I am issue" to rest. EDIT: This is a VERY helpful post so you should tag it as such.', '2011-05-11 14:14:31.000000', '2011-05-11 15:45:12.000000', 0),
(6410836, 949543, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kenskid:</b></div><hr/><i>... I gave a 5. ...</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hey, thanks!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-05-11 13:45:01.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by kenskid:... I gave a 5. ... Hey, thanks!', '2011-05-11 14:23:56.000000', '2011-05-11 14:45:01.000000', 0),
(6410893, 949543, 39057, '<td valign="top">What does it matter if it was last minute or your first vote? Either way it counts the same.<br/> <br/>Also....a 5 is not a low vote. Look at the winners and the dq in squares. They are surely worth one or two points higher than your entry.<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kenskid:</b></div><hr/><i>... I gave a 5. ...</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hey, thanks! </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-05-11 14:04:25.</i></td>', 'What does it matter if it was last minute or your first vote? Either way it counts the same. Also....a 5 is not a low vote. Look at the winners and the dq in squares. They are surely worth one or two points higher than your entry.Originally posted by hahn23: Originally posted by kenskid:... I gave a 5. ... Hey, thanks! ', '2011-05-11 14:52:16.000000', '2011-05-11 15:04:25.000000', 0),
(6410921, 949543, 39057, '<td valign="top"><br/>Well I see that you edited out your remark on "giving you a 5 in the last minute" and I was too late to include it in my reply. However...ill keep my reply the same.  Looks like you''re trying to change the tone of the discussion to make it look like im harassing you. Well go complain. <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hahn23:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kenskid:</b></div><hr/><i>... I gave a 5. ...</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hey, thanks! </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Well I see that you edited out your remark on "giving you a 5 in the last minute" and I was too late to include it in my reply. However...ill keep my reply the same.  Looks like you''re trying to change the tone of the discussion to make it look like im harassing you. Well go complain.  Originally posted by hahn23: Originally posted by kenskid:... I gave a 5. ... Hey, thanks! ', '2011-05-11 15:12:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6410941, 949543, 39057, '<td valign="top">Lol....I see you took out the whole reference to the last minute low vote in the photo description. Now it REALLY looks like you are trying to get someone booted.....hmmmm maybe ill complain about you!<br/> <br/>Its very sad that you can''t even stand by your own comments when someone offers a fair and winning reply. You actually cut your comment and ran.....all the while screaming "kenskid is screwing with me unfairly". Its also sad that ill now have to take screenshots everytime I reply to you in order to defend my comments when you go complain......SAD SAD SAD.<br/> <br/>Edit: Well for what it''s worth to any who may happen upon this comment thread:<br/> <br/>I voted in the last four minutes. Hahn included in his photo comments that someone gave him a "low" score in the last four minutes. I then replied with my screen shots showing that I gave him a fair and honest score.<br/> <br/>His reply to that post was something like "hey thanks for the 5 vote at the last minute, very haunting".<br/> <br/>I since have seen that he deleted his original comment from his photo description. This is very dubious behaviour on Richard''s part. <br/> <br/><b>BEWARE</b>: IF YOU COMMENT ON ANYTHING WRITTEN OR PHOTOGRAPHED BY RICHARD....MAKE A SCREENSHOT FOR BACKUP !<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-05-11 14:48:10.</i></td>', 'Lol....I see you took out the whole reference to the last minute low vote in the photo description. Now it REALLY looks like you are trying to get someone booted.....hmmmm maybe ill complain about you! Its very sad that you can''t even stand by your own comments when someone offers a fair and winning reply. You actually cut your comment and ran.....all the while screaming "kenskid is screwing with me unfairly". Its also sad that ill now have to take screenshots everytime I reply to you in order to defend my comments when you go complain......SAD SAD SAD. Edit: Well for what it''s worth to any who may happen upon this comment thread: I voted in the last four minutes. Hahn included in his photo comments that someone gave him a "low" score in the last four minutes. I then replied with my screen shots showing that I gave him a fair and honest score. His reply to that post was something like "hey thanks for the 5 vote at the last minute, very haunting". I since have seen that he deleted his original comment from his photo description. This is very dubious behaviour on Richard''s part.  BEWARE: IF YOU COMMENT ON ANYTHING WRITTEN OR PHOTOGRAPHED BY RICHARD....MAKE A SCREENSHOT FOR BACKUP !', '2011-05-11 15:22:21.000000', '2011-05-11 15:48:10.000000', 0),
