(6413477, 949634, 88897, '<td valign="top">I am totally confused on this one - I did not add graphics, clip art, computer rendered images or parts of other photographs<br/> <br/>So I;m not sure what to think now<br/> <br/>Someone please explain<br/>thanks<br/>Rene''e</td>', 'I am totally confused on this one - I did not add graphics, clip art, computer rendered images or parts of other photographs So I;m not sure what to think now Someone please explainthanksRene''e', '2011-05-14 13:28:16.000000', NULL, 0),
